// arrest_team: the next planning run while scenario 1's plan is running: s1, a and b are reserved. s2 surrenders,
// closest to b, but b is taken: c restrains s2, alone (a and b cannot cover).
// method: squad_tick
// expect: succeeded
//   1. !reserve c
//   2. !reserve s2
//   3. !restrain c s2
//   4. !wait_until_done c
//   5. !free c
//   6. !free s2

squadmember a
squadmember b
squadmember c
roster (a b c)
enemy s1
enemy s2
near s1 a 2.0
near s1 b 3.0
near s1 c 9.0
near s2 b 2.0
near s2 c 3.0
near s2 a 5.0
surrendered s1
surrendered s2
reserved a
reserved b
reserved s1
